Lihat ?

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:47.830
Orang kulit putih menghilang .

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:49.660
Kau benar .

00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:55.330
Dimana ada cahaya , ada bayangan .

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:59.340
